      "description": "Records WHICH responsibilities are deferred, never WHETHER the receiving contract exists. An `exists` property is deliberately absent and additionalProperties is false, so a cached existence flag cannot be reintroduced — that is what keeps this contract valid when 04, 06 or 07 are later authored."
